64.m:
At the doors one should place jars on a bhadraka, a crescent, or a svastika [diagram];
and having performed the establishment of the fire in the fire-pit, one should make the full oblation.
[Page 187]

65.m:
The Holy One said:
I shall describe the site of an assembly hall and the like, and likewise their construction;
and when the ground is examined, he should perform the rite of site architecture.
